# Rust
backend/target/
backend/**/*.rs.bk
# backend/Cargo.lock is tracked on purpose: this is an application, not a
# library, so every build and CI run has to resolve the same dependency
# versions. Without it, two builds of the same commit can differ.

# Node / SvelteKit
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.svelte-kit/
frontend/build/
frontend/.vite/
frontend/dist/

# Env
.env
.env.local
!.env.example

# Playwright
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/blob-report/
frontend/playwright/.cache/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

#skills
.atl/
.codegraph/

#PLAN & features
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose: an unanchored `plan-v1a.md` also
# matched `odd/tasks/plan-v1a.md`, the ODD feature document the subagents read.
# The working plans stay local; the feature document is part of the work.
/PLAN.md
/plan-v1.md
/plan-v1a.md

# impeccable runtime state (ephemeral, per-dev)
# impeccable-ignore-start
# Ephemeral output, runtime state, and per-dev overrides.
# The **/ prefix covers .impeccable at the repo root or in a nested workspace.
# Shared artifacts stay tracked: config.json, live/config.json,
# design.json, surfaces/*.md, critique/*.md.
**/.impeccable/config.local.json
**/.impeccable/hook.cache.json
**/.impeccable/hook.pending.json
**/.impeccable/*.png
**/.impeccable/review/
**/.impeccable/questions/
**/.impeccable/live/server.json
**/.impeccable/live/sessions/
**/.impeccable/live/previews/
**/.impeccable/live/annotations/
**/.impeccable/live/cache/
**/.impeccable/live/manual-edit-apply-transaction.json
**/.impeccable/live/manual-edit-events.jsonl
**/.impeccable/live/manual-edit-evidence/
**/.impeccable/live/pending-manual-edits.json
**/.impeccable/live/deferred-svelte-component-accepts.json
**/.impeccable/live/*.png
# impeccable-ignore-end

# impeccable-installed agent/skill bundle (per-machine, generated by the
# impeccable installer, not source of this project). Keeping it out of the
# untracked inventory is what lets the receipt-driven review see a declared
# candidate instead of stopping on intended-untracked-selection-required.
.agents/
.github/agents/
.github/skills/
